SDV test1:
VSS :
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)

    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake2 (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
 
